  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What is Gorai Mumbai known for?",
      "answer": "Gorai is known as Mumbai's most peaceful beach escape - home to Gorai Beach, Essel World (Mumbai's largest amusement park), Water Kingdom, the magnificent Global Vipassana Pagoda, the historic St. Bonaventure Church and the Gorai Creek mangroves. It is a quiet, green, village-like neighbourhood that feels worlds away from the city's chaos, yet is part of Greater Mumbai."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of Gorai?",
      "answer": "Gorai uses the pin code 400091, shared with parts of Borivali West."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the sub-areas within Gorai?",
      "answer": "The main micro-localities within Gorai are Gorai Beach, Gorai Village (Gorai Gaon), Gorai Creek, the Essel World / Water Kingdom belt, the Global Pagoda area, Gorai Road and the residential colonies along Gorai Link Road."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in Gorai?",
      "answer": "Property prices in Gorai are among the most affordable in Mumbai for a beach-adjacent location. 1BHK apartments range from ₹45–80 lakh. 2BHKs range from ₹75 lakh to ₹1.5 Cr. Rental rates for 1BHKs range from ₹8,000–₹15,000 per month and 2BHKs from ₹14,000–₹25,000 per month (as of June 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute from Gorai?",
      "answer": "Gorai is accessible by ferry from Borivali (Gorai Jetty) - a 10-minute boat ride across the creek. From Borivali station (Western Railway), it is a 15-minute auto-rickshaw ride to the jetty. The area is also accessible by road via Gorai Link Road from Borivali West. There is no direct railway station in Gorai."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are near Gorai?",
      "answer": "Major hospitals near Gorai include Bhagwati Hospital (Borivali), Wockhardt Hospital (Mira Road), Riddhi Vinayak Hospital (Borivali), Lifeline Hospital (Borivali) and several nursing homes and clinics in Borivali West, accessible via the Gorai Link Road or ferry."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which schools are in or near Gorai?",
      "answer": "Notable schools in and near Gorai include St. Bonaventure High School (Gorai), Gorai Municipal School, Carmel of St. Joseph School (Borivali), Ryan International School (Borivali) and several other schools in Borivali West accessible via Gorai Link Road."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do I find the best dentists in Gorai?",
      "answer": "Browse Mumbai96's Gorai listings, read reviews from locals and call directly. Our verified directory makes it easy to find the right dentist near Gorai Village, Gorai Beach or Gorai Link Road."
    }
